on Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"oYF96W1boB-0E3g3i8U_zw","review_id":"QA9C__BRLTJK27ju0D_Eog","date":"2015-09-21T16:17:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9223332405090332,"text_excerpt":"Ok so I'm on a mission to find the best pastries in the city. Winks was pretty good. I went with the Ginny early on a Sunday morning... There was no one in the place... Bad for business but good for us. We grab a few buttermilk drops and doughnut holes. First the good... The buttermilk drops were amazing! Definitely better than other popular spots I've tried. The doughnut holes... Not so much. They were a little tough... The glaze wasn't really impressive... We would have done better just sticking with the buttermilk drops."},{"business_id":"oYF96W1boB-0E3g3i8U_zw","review_id":"Coify-wjq93hfP1XAUUunQ","date":"2014-11-09T20:59:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9209331274032593,"text_excerpt":"I saw his hilarious YouTube video and had to make my way here to try their world famous buttermilk drops! I am very picky with donuts, nor do I even like em that much but these balls had me at hello. Oh my goodness. They are SO fluffy and moist, it's unreal. You would think it's gonna be dry inside but nah-ah, you can squeeze the insides together and use it to pick up all the sugary crumbs on the paper after you're done eating them! Hahahaha Oh yes baby, you know I did!! Their chicory coffee is hot and so delish. Probably the best coffee I had so far in New Orleans. Their service is so kind too. They lost my breakfast ticket, I ended up waiting over 20 minutes. They eventually found it an..."},{"business_id":"oYF96W1boB-0E3g3i8U_zw","review_id":"miGKUWubXKTA_cUebC1Xvg","date":"2015-06-23T00:16:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9149717092514038,"text_excerpt":"We were visiting New Orleans and while walking in the French Quarter we discovered Winks. Wow and WOW! I love, love, love these buttermilk drops. I do believe I will now be eating the drops over the beignets from now on. They are so soft and buttery and light and scrumptious. It was such a pleasant and wonderful discovery for us. The place was so clean and the staff was friendly and helpful and sweet. Besides the drops they also served breakfast. While sitting and drinking our lovely coffee, we noticed a steady stream of customers ordering breakfast sandwiches. Also on display were delicious looking fruit tarts and other sweet delights. We returned the next morning for more. This is a def..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"oYF96W1boB-0E3g3i8U_zw","photo_id":"iFiwgFJ8f67KrnnGFSg71Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iFiwgFJ8f67KrnnGFSg71Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.966812014579773},{"business_id":"oYF96W1boB-0E3g3i8U_zw","photo_id":"tzLDQm-r-vZdczd8q7E0Sg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tzLDQm-r-vZdczd8q7E0Sg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9639727473258972},{"business_id":"oYF96W1boB-0E3g3i8U_zw","photo_id":"GaPa2quVJazccFaiUpTVWw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/GaPa2quVJazccFaiUpTVWw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9187747836112976},{"business_id":"oYF96W1boB-0E3g3i8U_zw","photo_id":"agbj9iAxP7Qb4os2E5mIfA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/agbj9iAxP7Qb4os2E5mIfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8730501532554626}]},"notebook_case":null}
